              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon me; because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath anointed me to preach good tidings unto the meek; he hath sent me to bind up the brokenhearted, to proclaim liberty to the captives, and the opening of the prison to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bound;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To proclaim the acceptable year of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the day of vengeance of our God; to comfort all that mourn;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To appoint unto them that mourn in Zion, to give unto them beauty for ashes, the oil of joy for mourning, the garment of praise for the spirit of heaviness; that they might be called trees of righteousness, the planting of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that he might be glorified.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And they shall build the old wastes, they shall raise up the former desolations, and they shall repair the waste cities, the desolations of many generations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And strangers shall stand and feed your flocks, and the sons of the alien",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your plowmen and your vinedressers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ye shall be named the Priests of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall call you the Ministers of our God: ye shall eat the riches of the Gentiles, and in their glory shall ye boast yourselves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ For your shame",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ye shall have",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "double; and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "confusion they shall rejoice in their portion: therefore in their land they shall possess the double: everlasting joy shall be unto them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "love judgment, I hate robbery for burnt offering; and I will direct their work in truth, and I will make an everlasting covenant with them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And their seed shall be known among the Gentiles, and their offspring among the people: all that see them shall acknowledge them, that they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the seed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath blessed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will greatly rejoice in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", my soul shall be joyful in my God; for he hath clothed me with the garments of salvation, he hath covered me with the robe of righteousness, as a bridegroom decketh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "himself",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with ornaments, and as a bride adorneth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "herself",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with her jewels.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as the earth bringeth forth her bud, and as the garden causeth the things that are sown in it to spring forth; so the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.61.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.61.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will cause righteousness and praise to spring forth before all the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
